          "_name": "list01",
          "_sourceTheme": "ridem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list01 ridem5\" group=\"List\" plugins=\"mbr-switch-arrow, mobirise-icons2\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDesc\">\n        <header>List</header>\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"icon\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon BG\" value=\"#000000\" name=\"iconBg\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#3a7d04\" name=\"border\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#e7f4c9\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\">\n                        <b>URBAN MOBILITY</b>\n                    </p>\n                    <div id=\"bootstrap-accordion\" class=\"panel-group accordionStyles accordion\" role=\"tablist\" aria-multiselectable=\"true\">\n                        <div class=\"card\">\n                            <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                                <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n                                    <h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\"><b>Rug Steam Cleaning</b></h4>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-wrapper\">\n                                        <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                                <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                    <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; background-color: transparent;\">Specialising in all types of rug steam cleaning whether it’s an authentic silk rug or synthetic rug in the kids play room that has more slime than fabric.. We’ve got you covered!</span></li><li class=\"item-wrap\">On every job we include a sanitiser to help kill dust mites and bacteria; a deodoriser to help eliminate bad odours; and stain treatment products to help remove stains.\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\">Over the years we have experimented and tweaked the process in order to deliver the best results possible.\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\">We do this with our blueprint 5 step process.\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Step 1: </b>Rotary turbo vacuum the rugs\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Step 2: </b>Apply a pre spray chemical and spot treat all stains\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Step 3: </b>Agitate with a scrubbing machine\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Step 4: </b>Hot water extraction steam clean with an Airflex Storm (best on the market)\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Step 5: </b>Install dryers to speed dry the rugs\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b><br></b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n                            <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingTwo\">\n                                <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n                                    <h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\"><b>Water Tank Cleaning</b></h4>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-wrapper\">\n                                        <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingTwo\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                                <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                    <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; background-color: transparent;\">Most homes in the country have attic water tanks. But not many people know that it should be cleaned regularly as it builds with bacteria, mold, algae and viruses. Not what you want to be showering and brushing your teeth with!</span><br></li><li class=\"item-wrap\">Domestic and commercial water tank cleaning is essential for water hygiene and legionella control. It is likely that over time your tank will develop sediment, silt and rust.\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\">This can lead to a significant deterioration of water quality and if not maintained properly could pose serious health risks.\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\">\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; background-color: transparent;\">Regular cleaning and disinfecting of water tanks is essential to ensure the water stays clean and bacteria free. It is recommended to get the water tanks cleaned at least once a year.</span><br></li><li class=\"item-wrap\">For businesses, neglecting the cleaning and disinfecting of water tanks can lead to non-compliance with Safety, Health and Welfare at Work Act 2005.\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\">Here is our cleaning process:\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Step 1: </b>Drain the contaminated water from the tank\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Step 2: </b>Clean, disinfect and chlorinate the inside of the tank\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Step 3: </b>Refill the tank and add a decontamination solution\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b><br></b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n                            <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                                <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n                                    <h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\"><b>Fabric Protection (Scotchgard)</b></h4>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-wrapper\">\n                                        <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                                <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                    <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\">Did you know that you can have your prized possessions including rugs, carpets and upholstery professionally protected against stains, scuffs and wear and tear. \n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\">That’s right.. We don’t just clean.. We also protect your valuables.\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\">\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; background-color: transparent;\">Here at Go Green we can protect not only brand new furnishings but also antique rugs and couches and everything in between. It prolongs the life of your carpets and upholstery maintaining its aesthetic appeal.</span><br></li><li class=\"item-wrap\">We apply the solution to the fabric creating an invisible shield to help keep out dirt, spillages and staining. It then makes it easier to clean the fabric yourself as the shield helps keep everything from seeping through.\n</li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b><br></b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>\n</b></li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 3\">\n                            <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFour\">\n                                <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n                                    <h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\">\n                                        <b>Compact Folding Scooter</b>\n                                    </h4>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-wrapper\">\n                                        <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFour\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                                <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                    <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Small</b> stature</li>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Delivers</b> impressive power and acceleration</li>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Short</b> commutes and urban errands</li>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Quick-folding</b> mechanism</li>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Lightweight</b> construction</li>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Easy</b> maneuverability</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 4\">\n                            <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFive\">\n                                <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n                                    <h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\">\n                                        <b>Electric Kick Scooter</b>\n                                    </h4>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-wrapper\">\n                                        <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFive\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                                <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                    <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Lightweight</b> frame</li>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Responsive</b> handling</li>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Easy</b> to ride and maneuver through tight spaces</li>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Intuitive</b> throttle control</li>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Regenerative</b> braking system</li>\n                                        <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Compact</b> size</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "list01-1b",
          "_cid": "uSeIfcRqlV",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0 60px",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0 30px"
                }
              }
            },
            ".container": {
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 30px"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "justify-content": "center"
            },
            ".map-wrapper": {
              "height": "386px",
              "background-color": "@container",
              "position": "relative",
              "padding": "40px 40px 0 40px",
              "margin-bottom": "134px",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "20px 20px 0 20px"
              },
              ".google-map": {
                "iframe": {
                  "height": "418px",
                  "border-radius": "0 !important"
                }
              }
            },
            ".items-wrapper": {
              "display": "grid",
              "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr 1fr",
              "gap": "20px",
              "padding-left": "100px",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "display": "block",
                "padding-left": "0"
              },
              ".item": {
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "margin-bottom": "30px"
                },
                ".item-wrapper": {
                  ".card-box": {
                    ".item-title": {
                      "margin-bottom": "10px"
                    },
                    ".desc-wrap": {
                      "&:hover, &:focus": {
                        ".item-desc::before": {
                          "width": "100%"
                        }
                      },
                      ".item-desc": {
                        "display": "inline-flex",
                        "width": "fit-content",
                        "margin-bottom": "0",
                        "position": "relative",
                        "&::before": {
                          "content": "''",
                          "position": "absolute",
                          "bottom": "0",
                          "left": "0",
                          "height": "2px",
                          "width": "0",
                          "background-color": "@active",
                          "transition": "all .3s ease"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".item-menu-overlay": {
              ".btn-wrapper": {
                "margin-top": "-10%"
              }
            },
            ".item-title": {
              "color": "#144031"
            },
            ".item-desc": {
              "color": "#144031"
            },
            ".item-desc, .desc-wrap": {
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_name": "map01",
          "_sourceTheme": "carem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"map01 carem5\" group=\"Contact\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Contacts\" name=\"showContacts\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showTitle\" condition=\"showContacts\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Description\" name=\"showDesc\" condition=\"showContacts\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Active Color\" value=\"#d0e59f\" name=\"active\" condition=\"showContacts\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Container BG\" value=\"#d0e59f\" name=\"container\" selected>\n        <header>Map</header>\n        <input type=\"map\" title=\"Map\" name=\"googleMap\" place-id=\"<iframe src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d1224464.5840025528!2d-7.307646!3d53.172429!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0xa1dfc1260cbe99d%3A0x4387566953b2f7b9!2sGo%20Green%20Steam%20Clean!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sie!4v1753107850151!5m2!1sen!2sie&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; height=&quot;600&quot; style=&quot;border:0;&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer-when-downgrade&quot;></iframe>\" value=\"<iframe src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d1224464.5840025528!2d-7.307646!3d53.172429!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0xa1dfc1260cbe99d%3A0x4387566953b2f7b9!2sGo%20Green%20Steam%20Clean!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sie!4v1753107850151!5m2!1sen!2sie&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; height=&quot;600&quot; style=&quot;border:0;&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer-when-downgrade&quot;></iframe>\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/carem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#e7f4c9\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/carem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#000000\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.4\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-10\">\n                <div class=\"map-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"google-map\" mbr-map=\"googleMap\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"items-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showContacts\">\n                    <div class=\"item features-without-image\">\n                        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"card-box card\">\n                                <h4 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .icon-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                                    <b>PHONE</b>\n                                </h4>\n                                <div class=\"desc-wrap\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\">\n                                        <p class=\"item-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-desc, .desc-wrap\">\n                                            We cover&nbsp;Laois, Kildare, Carlow, Kilkenny, Tipperary, Offaly and Westmeath</p>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
